  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISK for MLSA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK for MLSA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges ambassad i Ankara har undertecknat ett avtal med f&#xf6;reningen f&#xf6;r medie- och r&#xe4;ttsstudier (MLSA &#x2013; Medya ve Hukuk &#xc7;alismalari Dernegi) &#xe5;r 2025. F&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att den nya samarbetspartnern har l&#xe4;mpliga interna kontrollsystem har Sida inf&#xf6;rt en ISK-granskning som ett villkor i avtalet f&#xf6;r 2026. Sida anser att det &#xe4;r viktigt att genomf&#xf6;ra denna granskning f&#xf6;r att kunna identifiera och &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rda eventuella brister under projektets genomf&#xf6;rande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy of Sweden in Ankara has signed an agreement with the Media and Law Studies Association (MLSA &#x2013; Medya ve Hukuk &#xc7;alismalari Dernegi) in 2025. In order to ensure that the new partner has the relevant  internal control systems, Sida has included an ISK review as a agreement condition for 2026. Sida considers it important to carry out this review in order to identify and address any potential shortcomings during project implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
